<title>USA: U.S. Medical says CEO resigns.</title>
<headline>U.S. Medical says CEO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Medical Alliance Inc said on Tuesday that Nazir Memon resigned as Chief Executive. The company named Chairman Ilyas Rajput to serve as interim CEO.</p>
<p>The company said it is pursuing a replacement CEO.</p>
<p>U.S. Medical provides physician management services.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
